title: The index of open questions is stale.
pid: c7e57ce7-d59e-41b2-9f38-ca670b40be77
body: |2-
  "2026-11-13, 06:33: Every question I have open with you, in one
  place" lists none of the questions written after it (at least nine),
  lists two its own later messages settled (the cycling toggles, the
  jumping cursor), and repeats eight that are also messages of their
  own lower down.
